oronto brides from reading everyone&#039;s posts over the last few months, lol.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"snswedding2016\"] A patio sounds like a great idea! We&#039;re likely all spread around the city a bit, but I imagine as long as the location we pick is near transit everyone should be able to get there relatively easy.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896804,"PostDate":1432240877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Awesome idea @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281803\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281803-ruzanna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Ruzanna<\/span><\/a>! I feel like I already know all the Toronto brides from reading everyone's posts over the last few months, lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> A patio sounds like a great idea! We're likely all spread around the city a bit, but I imagine as long as the location we pick is near transit everyone should be able to get there relatively easy.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFacto