Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":191,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1910129,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":286064,"Name":"Vivthebride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286064.jpg?_r=1454118648","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1453922665,"LastPoster":{"Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1910129,"PostDate":1453922665,"PostContent":"Soooo I've almost been dreading being engaged because I know how type A I am and how stressful we...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vivian_pham@live.com","IpAddress":"104.6.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453920446,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286064.jpg?_r=1454118648","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Vivthebride","Id":286064,"Name":"Vivthebride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.6.204.185","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54cfc02dfb6f795e01a70f37d20bb3d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Soooo I&#039;ve almost been dreading being engaged because I know how type A I am and how stressful wedding planning can be. I have heard that destination weddings are not only more affordable but also less stressful so that is what we have decided on....and thats about it. Don&#039;t even know where to start, but I feel like as soon as we pick a destination and a venue (some all-inclusive resort) that the rest will be downhill from there. Soooooo that&#039;s where I&#039;m at. Any help\/suggestions for a beach destination that is affordable would be GREAT! We live in Dallas and so do all of our friends and all of MY family. My fiance&#039;s family however, lives in DC. Soooo we just need a great all inclusive family friendly resort that will be enjoyable and affordable for everyone!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910129,"PostDate":1453922665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Soooo I've almost been dreading being engaged because I know how type A I am and how stressful wedding planning can be. I have heard that destination weddings are not only more affordable but also less stressful so that is what we have decided on....and thats about it. Don't even know where to start, but I feel like as soon as we pick a destination and a venue (some all-inclusive resort) that the rest will be downhill from there. Soooooo that's where I'm at. Any help\/suggestions for a beach destination that is affordable would be GREAT! We live in Dallas and so do all of our friends and all of MY family. My fiance's family however, lives in DC. Soooo we just need a great all inclusive family friendly resort that will be enjoyable and affordable for everyone!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vivian_pham@live.com","IpAddress":"104.6.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453920446,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286064.jpg?_r=1454118648","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Vivthebride","Id":286064,"Name":"Vivthebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2cecd04a3e4f014e363595ddb57a6d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Vivthebride\"] Welcome to the forum, where you ca start is simply contacting a Travel agent, I always suggest you look at one that is dedicated to destination wedding. Also you might want to ask yourself what are the amenities resort should have. also what price point do you consider affordable for you and your guests.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910145,"PostDate":1453955251,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286064\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286064-vivthebride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vivthebride<\/span><\/a> Welcome to the forum, where you ca start is simply contacting a Travel agent, I always suggest you look at one that is dedicated to destination wedding. Also you might want to ask yourself what are the amenities resort should have. also what price point do you consider affordable for you and your guests.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"702419f0f4ba389bb968c2f982f593ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome,\n\n\nI&#039;m sure you&#039;ll hear lots of opinions on this, but I don&#039;t think that destination weddings always more affordable and they definitely aren&#039;t less stressful. I think the stigma behind them is that you just pick a resort and that&#039;s it, but planning is still involved as is looking for vendors, decor etc (photography).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I wish you all the luck with your wedding planning venture and congrats on being engaged! Although it&#039;s stressful it&#039;s a fun time and I&#039;d do it over again and again if I could.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910168,"PostDate":1453989487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome,<br><br>\nI'm sure you'll hear lots of opinions on this, but I don't think that destination weddings always more affordable and they definitely aren't less stressful. I think the stigma behind them is that you just pick a resort and that's it, but planning is still involved as is looking for vendors, decor etc (photography).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wish you all the luck with your wedding planning venture and congrats on being engaged! Although it's stressful it's a fun time and I'd do it over again and again if I could.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82837ccb5a9888b1d7cff5cb2c1db657","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The first place to start is to talk to a destination wedding specialist to go over what your wants are and what you are envisioning.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have some great ones on the board and you can use my link in my siggy to contact one :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910172,"PostDate":1453999490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The first place to start is to talk to a destination wedding specialist to go over what your wants are and what you are envisioning.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have some great ones on the board and you can use my link in my siggy to contact one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Yesterday, 10:56 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1454007419,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08b9024c9313f30096b07cee784f3c1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, and Congrats on your engagement and upcoming dw!!! You&#039;re off to a great start already just by joining us, and will find tons of helpful info, advice, suggestions and support from everyone here - so well done :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our magnificent Mayan Riviera is a very popular choice with LOTs of wedding couples.... and you can see why in these magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured here.....enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Timeline Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/12487136_10153858246954487_3478990130776249419_o.jpg\" alt=\"12487136_10153858246954487_3478990130776\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/469143_10151586162909487_1909676281_o.jpg\" alt=\"469143_10151586162909487_1909676281_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347900185_o.jpg\" alt=\"11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216435992_o.jpg\" alt=\"11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1397538_10151964572534487_1408394271_o.jpg\" alt=\"1397538_10151964572534487_1408394271_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and that you totally Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910174,"PostDate":1454007356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, and Congrats on your engagement and upcoming dw!!! You're off to a great start already just by joining us, and will find tons of helpful info, advice, suggestions and support from everyone here - so well done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our magnificent Mayan Riviera is a very popular choice with LOTs of wedding couples.... and you can see why in these magical wedding moments that matter we've captured here.....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Timeline Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/12487136_10153858246954487_3478990130776249419_o.jpg\" alt=\"12487136_10153858246954487_3478990130776\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/469143_10151586162909487_1909676281_o.jpg\" alt=\"469143_10151586162909487_1909676281_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347900185_o.jpg\" alt=\"11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216435992_o.jpg\" alt=\"11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1397538_10151964572534487_1408394271_o.jpg\" alt=\"1397538_10151964572534487_1408394271_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and that you totally Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d10084003f2c510e3857115e9d0f28e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello and Congratulations! Planning a destination can definitely be overwhelming and where do you start? We&#039;re here to help. &amp;nbsp;Just click on the link above \"Contact a BDW Agent\" and we are happy to answer any questions you may have and help you plan your dream destination wedding! Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910179,"PostDate":1454017269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello and Congratulations! Planning a destination can definitely be overwhelming and where do you start? We're here to help. \u00a0Just click on the link above \"Contact a BDW Agent\" and we are happy to answer any questions you may have and help you plan your dream destination wedding! Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5606b920417e75ca64282fd5dcd0af8c","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;Hi&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286064-vivthebride\/\" title=\"\"&gt;Vivthebride&lt;\/a&gt;!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff11c1;\"&gt;Congratulations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt; on your engagement!!! Have you ever thing about an amazing and exclusive natural location for your wedding?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;Las Caletas is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest. We have 3 different wedding packages (according to your guests numer).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;Source Sans Pro&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;In Puerto Vallarta, you will find plenty accommodation options in the city, classified from A to Z, by region and by category, comfortable hotels, to luxurious and exclusive resorts.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;For more info or formal proposal please contact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82473]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18066]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910231,"PostDate":1454099088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\">Hi\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286064-vivthebride\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Vivthebride<\/a>!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff11c1\">Congratulations<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"> on your engagement!!! Have you ever thing about an amazing and exclusive natural location for your wedding?\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\">Las Caletas is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest. We have 3 different wedding packages (according to your guests numer).<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#696969\"><span  style=\"font-family:'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;\">In Puerto Vallarta, you will find plenty accommodation options in the city, classified from A to Z, by region and by category, comfortable hotels, to luxurious and exclusive resorts.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#696969\">For more info or formal proposal please contact:\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82473-img-0745\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_1893296.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 0745'  width='200' height='134'  alt='IMG 0745' id='sml_image_view_82473' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18066-wedding-entertainment\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18066\/tn_gallery_258213_18066_1969336.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Let\u00b4s dance to the color of LOVE#AdventureWeddings#DestinationWeddings#PuertoVallarta'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Let\u00b4s dance to the color of LOVE#AdventureWeddings#DestinationWeddings#PuertoVallarta' id='tn_image_view_81501_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18066-wedding-entertainment\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Wedding Entertainment<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>12 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343058803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79898","Title":"Newbie - Planning A Destination Wedding - Overwhelmed!","LastPostDate":1454099088},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
