{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79862,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e8339f941103a7c1c801ff462322368","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"beachbeth\"]! &amp;nbsp;Don&#039;t feel discouraged, like the ladies said you just need to find the right agent. &amp;nbsp;This was the hardest part of the process for me so far and I&#039;m 3 1\/2 months away from my day.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We used Total Advantage Travel &amp;amp; Tours in Toronto and they were able to beat our original quote by $130 for each guest. Making my guests travel only $1259 pp incl tax from April 26-May 3. &amp;nbsp;I know it&#039;s not the season you&#039;re looking for but it&#039;s worth reaching out to them for a quote.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and keep us posted!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909559,"PostDate":1452876506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285906\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285906-beachbeth\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beachbeth<\/span><\/a>! \u00a0Don't feel discouraged, like the ladies said you just need to find the right agent. \u00a0This was the hardest part of the process for me so far and I'm 3 1\/2 months away from my day.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We used Total Advantage Travel & Tours in Toronto and they were able to beat our original quote by $130 for each guest. Making my guests travel only $1259 pp incl tax from April 26-May 3. \u00a0I know it's not the season you're looking for but it's worth reaching out to them for a quote.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and keep us posted!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.63.159.222","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79862,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aba97dc491ee9aa6087854db7b05402f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"deecol\" post=\"1909559\" timestamp=\"1452876506\"]\nHi @[member=\"beachbeth\"]!  Don&#039;t feel discouraged, like the ladies said you just need to find the right agent.  This was the hardest part of the process for me so far and I&#039;m 3 1\/2 months away from my day.\n\nWe used Total Advantage Travel &amp;amp; Tours in Toronto and they were able to beat our original quote by $130 for each guest. Making my guests travel only $1259 pp incl tax from April 26-May 3.  I know it&#039;s not the season you&#039;re looking for but it&#039;s worth reaching out to them for a quote.\n\nGood luck and keep us posted![\/quote]Thanks I definitely will. Everytime I think of planning one at home I just \"Nope!\" right out of there. I know the beach is the way to go!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909573,"PostDate":1452890484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>deecol, on 15 January 2016 - 08:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285906\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285906-beachbeth\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beachbeth<\/span><\/a>! \u00a0Don't feel discouraged, like the ladies said you just need to find the right agent. \u00a0This was the hardest part of the process for me so far and I'm 3 1\/2 months away from my day.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We used Total Advantage Travel & Tours in Toronto and they were able to beat our original quote by $130 for each guest. Making my guests travel only $1259 pp incl tax from April 26-May 3. \u00a0I know it's not the season you're looking for but it's worth reaching out to them for a quote.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and keep us posted!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks I definitely will. Everytime I think of planning one at home I just \"Nope!\" right out of there. I know the beach is the way to go!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethsenecawedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.63.159.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452826028,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beachbeth","Id":285906,"Name":"beachbeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79862,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84244354a117db21f1e8a76807261271","RawContent":"We are going to Mayan riviera at Sandos Caracol Dec 1-8 from Edmonton.  Prices were 1775 a person.  I&#039;m not sure if that is close enough to Christmas for you though.  \n\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909639,"PostDate":1453070347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to Mayan riviera at Sandos Caracol Dec 1-8 from Edmonton.  Prices were 1775 a person.  I'm not sure if that is close enough to Christmas for you though.  <br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpenner@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1451960069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285764.jpg?_r=1451960071","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tpenner","Id":285764,"Name":"tpenner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79862,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d969351625e59a699deedb35e139c8e8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tpenner\" post=\"1909639\" timestamp=\"1453070347\"]\nWe are going to Mayan riviera at Sandos Caracol Dec 1-8 from Edmonton.  Prices were 1775 a person.  I&#039;m not sure if that is close enough to Christmas for you though.  \n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk[\/quote]I&#039;ve stayed there and enjoyed it :) congrats. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909641,"PostDate":1453072340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tpenner, on 17 January 2016 - 02:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We are going to Mayan riviera at Sandos Caracol Dec 1-8 from Edmonton.  Prices were 1775 a person.  I'm not sure if that is close enough to Christmas for you though.  <br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI've stayed there and enjoyed it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> congrats. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.81.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79862,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd1d0b0850ad30a7fb4c072de8296f4f","RawContent":"Also remember our dollar keeps going down, so that factors a lot with pricing !","Attachments":[],"Id":1909683,"PostDate":1453167850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Also remember our dollar keeps going down, so that factors a lot with pricing !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannakawecki@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.81.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446521008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deannak","Id":285230,"Name":"Deannak","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2