\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/1d\/a3\/a1\/1da3a19e48858cfbb6f9493a7df65719.jpg\" alt=\"1da3a19e48858cfbb6f9493a7df65719.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/9\/optimized\/1988849_fpx.tif?wid=262&amp;amp;hei=320&amp;amp;fit=fit,1&amp;amp;$filtersm$\" alt=\"1988849_fpx.tif?wid=262&amp;amp;hei=320&amp;amp;fit=fit,\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/8\/optimized\/2025308_fpx.tif?wid=262&amp;amp;hei=320&amp;amp;fit=fit,1&amp;amp;$filtersm$\" alt=\"2025308_fpx.tif?wid=262&amp;amp;hei=320&amp;amp;fit=fit,\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/5\/optimized\/2169755_fpx.tif?wid=262&amp;amp;hei=320&amp;amp;fit=fit,1&amp;amp;$filtersm$\" alt=\"2169755_fpx.tif?wid=262&amp;amp;hei=320&amp;amp;fit=fit,\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/1\/optimized\/3031401_fpx.tif?wid=600&amp;amp;hei=510&amp;amp;fit=fit,1&amp;amp;$filterxlrg$\" alt=\"3031401_fpx.tif?wid=600&amp;amp;hei=510&amp;amp;fit=fit,\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/g.nordstromimage.com\/imagegallery\/store\/product\/Gigantic\/6\/_9172826.jpg\" alt=\"_9172826.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904165,"PostDate":1441383569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My dress, sorry for the crazy sized pics:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/1d\/a3\/a1\/1da3a19e48858cfbb6f9493a7df65719.jpg\" alt=\"1da3a19e48858cfbb6f9493a7df65719.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/9\/optimized\/1988849_fpx.tif?wid=262&hei=320&fit=fit,1&$filtersm$\" alt=\"1988849_fpx.tif?wid=262&hei=320&fit=fit,\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/8\/optimized\/2025308_fpx.tif?wid=262&hei=320&fit=fit,1&$filtersm$\" alt=\"2025308_fpx.tif?wid=262&hei=320&fit=fit,\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/5\/optimized\/2169755_fpx.tif?wid=262&hei=320&fit=fit,1&$filtersm$\" alt=\"2169755_fpx.tif?wid=262&hei=320&fit=fit,\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/slimages.macys.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/1\/optimized\/3031401_fpx.tif?wid=600&hei=510&fit=fit,1&$filterxlrg$\" alt=\"3031401_fpx.tif?wid=600&hei=510&fit=fit,\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/g.nordstromimage.com\/imagegallery\/store\/product\/Gigantic\/6\/_9172826.jpg\" alt=\"_9172826.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397440022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79564,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c01097af0e0bd23c53a344ef49ba71cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oooh! I remember you posted it before but I love your dress!!!&amp;nbsp; A simple, modern silhouette but still very unique.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I like the first and last the best - with a preference for the last. So I guess that means I like the jewel detail with your dress over the whole shoe being sparkly. I think those would look so totally gorgeous and chic with your dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904169,"PostDate":1441391120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oooh! I remember you posted it before but I love your dress!!!\u00a0 A simple, modern silhouette but still very unique.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like the first and last the best - with a preference for the last. So I guess that means I like the jewel detail with your dress over the whole shoe being sparkly. I think those would look so totally gorgeous and chic with your dress!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.191.93.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79564,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0eee800697e2e5e40592dcd53461332","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"malyna\"].....I like the first and the last as well. &amp;nbsp;I actually bought the first ones and I am wearing them with my reception dress. &amp;nbsp;They are really comfortable. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904178,"PostDate":1441406136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a>.....I like the first and the last as well. \u00a0I actually bought the first ones and I am wearing them with my reception dress. \u00a0They are really comfortable. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Formatted