oninabottle.com\/Beach_Weddings_s\/12.htm&#039;&gt;beach wedding invitation wording&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; is best thing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Many Invitation Bottle designs featuring&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Beach, Starfish, Sand &amp;amp; Seashells.&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your Invitation, Announcement, Save the Date or Thank You goes inside the bottle.&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Free professional design, proof and printing with assembled invitations.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Available in both plastic bottles and glass bottles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/nullrefer.com\/?http:\/\/www.invitationinabottle.com\/Beach_Weddings_s\/12.htm&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.invitationinabottle.com\/Beach_Weddings_s\/12.htm&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908572,"PostDate":1450759702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><b><a href='http:\/\/www.invitationinabottle.com\/Beach_Weddings_s\/12.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>beach wedding invitation wording<\/a>\u00a0 is best thing.\u00a0<\/b><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Many Invitation Bottle designs featuring\u00a0<\/span><b>Beach, Starfish, Sand & Seashells.<\/b><\/p>\n<p>Your Invitation, Announcement, Save the Date or Thank You goes inside the bottle.<span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Free professional design, proof and printing with assembled invitations.<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:14p