\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908823]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-282697-0-09858700-1451700794.png\" title=\"YouDoodleDrawing.png -  123.51KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-282697-0-09858700-1451700794.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"YouDoodleDrawing.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1908823]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-282697-0-08446600-1451700813.jpg\" title=\"invite.JPG -  122.7KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-282697-0-08446600-1451700813.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"invite.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I used Vanessa's Wedding Passports and she had a template specific to my resort (Dreams Los Cabos).<\/div>\n<div>I used a local graphic artist to help with the little details and with the printing.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rhomes.jones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.21.125.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428695691,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282697.jpg?_r=1436371862","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dandi76","Id":282697,"Name":"dandi76","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.231.40.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79825,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa84d15d700bfff5be0adbb4f9eaca10","RawContent":"They look great! Ill have to look in